hadiths[94]{hadithnumber,text}:
"769","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Fazl Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey sawaar they. To Khasam ki aik aurat aai. To Fazl uski taraf dekhney lagey aur wo unki taraf dekhney lagi. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fazl key chehrey ko doosrey pehlu ki taraf pherney lagey. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah ka apne bandon par Hajj ka fareeza merey waalid ko budhey badey honay ki haalat mein paaya hai jo sawaari par jam na saktey. To kya main unki taraf se Hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Aur wo Hajjat-ul-Wada mein tha. (Bukhari: 1513)"
"770","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap Zul Hulaifa mein apni oontni par sawaar hotey, phir talbiya kehtey yahan tak ke wo Aap ko ley kar seedhi khadi hoti. (Bukhari: 1514)"
"771","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kajawey par Hajj kya jabke wo Aapki sawaari thi. (Bukhari: 1517)"
"772","[AI-translation] Aisha Ummul Momineen (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham jihaad ko afzal amal samajhtey hain, to kya ham jihaad na karein? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, lekin afzal jihaad Hajj-e-Mabroor hai. (Bukhari: 1520)"
"773","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Allah key liye Hajj karey aur na behuda baat karey aur na gunaah karey to wapas hota hai jaisey us din tha jis din uski maan ne use jana tha. (Bukhari: 1521)"
"774","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina walon key liye Zul Hulaifa, aur Shaam walon key liye Juhfa, aur Najd walon key liye Qarn-ul-Manaazil, aur Yaman walon key liye Yalamlam muqarrar kya. Wo un walon key liye aur har aaney waley key liye jo un par se guzrey unkey siwa mein se, jo Hajj aur Umrah ka iraada rakkhey. Phir jo us se neechey ho to jahaan se shuru karey, yahan tak ke Makkah waley Makkah se. (Bukhari: 1530)"
"775","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Batha mein Zul Hulaifa key paas oont bithaaya aur us mein namaz padhi. Aur Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) aisa kartey they. (Bukhari: 1532)"
"776","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Darakht waley raastey se nikaltey aur Muarras waley raastey se daakhil hotey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Makkah ki taraf nikaltey to Darakht ki masjid mein namaz padhtey. Aur jab wapas aatey to Zul Hulaifa mein naaley key pet mein namaz padhtey aur raat guzaartey yahan tak ke subah hoti. (Bukhari: 1533)"
"777","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Wadi Aqiq mein farmatey huey suna: Merey paas aaj raat merey Rab ki taraf se aaney wala aaya aur us ne kaha: Is mubaarak waadi mein namaz padho aur kaho: Hajj mein Umrah. (Bukhari: 1534)"
"778","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ko dekha gaya jabke Aap Zul Hulaifa mein naaley key pet mein Muarras mein they. Aap se kaha gaya: Beshak tum mubaarak Batha mein ho. (Bukhari: 1535)"
"779","[AI-translation] Yala bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Mujhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dikhaao jab Aap par wahi naazil hoti hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jiraana mein they aur Aap key sath Aap key sahaaba mein se giroh tha ke Aap key paas aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap kya kehtey hain aisey aadmi key baarey mein jis ne Umrah ka ehraam baandha jabke wo khushbu mein basa hua hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghadi bhar khaamosh rahey. To Aap par wahi aai. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne meri taraf ishaara kya aur main aaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par kapda tha jis se Aap par saaya kya gaya tha. To main ne apna sar daakhil kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra surkh tha aur Aap kharraatey ley rahey they. Phir Aap se (wo kefiyat) door hui. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo kahaan hai jis ne Umrah key baarey mein poochha tha? To aadmi laaya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo khushbu tum mein hai use teen martaba dho daalo. Aur apne aap se jubba utaar do. Aur apne Umrah mein waisa karo jaisa apne Hajj mein kartey ho. (Bukhari: 1536)"
"780","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Aap key ehraam baandhney key waqt khushbu lagaati thi jab Aap ehraam baandhtey. Aur Aap key halaal honay key liye, Bait ka tawaaf karney se pehley. (Bukhari: 1539)"
"781","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko suna ke Aap baal jama kar (gondh) kar talbiya kehtey they. (Bukhari: 1540)"
"782","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid key paas key siwa ehraam na baandha. Yaani Zul Hulaifa ki masjid. (Bukhari: 1541)"
"783","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Usaama (Raziallahu anhu) Arafaat se Muzdalifa tak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key peechey sawaar they. Phir Aap ne Muzdalifa se Mina tak Fazl ko sawaar kya. To donon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) musalsal talbiya kehtey rahey yahan tak ke Aap ne Jamra-tul-Aqaba ki rami ki. (Bukhari: 1543, 1544)"
"784","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina se nikley jab Aap kanghi kar chukey aur tel lagaa chukey they aur apna tehband aur chaadar pehen chukey they, Aap aur Aap key sahaaba. To Aap ne chaadaron aur tehbandon mein se jo pehni jaati hain kisi cheez se mana na kya magar zaafraani (rangeen) jo jild par nishaan chhorey. To Aap Zul Hulaifa mein subah key, apni oontni par sawaar huey. Yahan tak ke wo Aap ko ley kar Baida par seedhi hui to Aap ne aur Aap key sahaaba ne talbiya kaha aur Aap ne apni qurbaani key oont ko haar pehnaaya. Aur wo Zul Qaada ki paanch (raatein) baaqi honay par tha. To Aap Zul Hijja ki chaar raatein guzarney par Makkah tashreef laaey. To Aap ne Bait ka tawaaf kya aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan sayi ki. Aur apni qurbaani ki wajah se halaal na huey kyunke Aap ne use haar pehnaaya tha. Phir Aap Makkah key baalaai hissey mein Hajoon key paas utrey jabke Aap Hajj ka ehraam baandhey huey they. Aur Aap ne Kaaba key qareeb na jaaney ka, uska tawaaf karney key baad, yahan tak ke Aap Arafaat se wapas aey. Aur Aap ne apne sahaaba ko hukm diya ke wo Bait ka aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan tawaaf karein, phir apne saron se baal katwaaein, phir halaal ho jaaein. Aur wo uskey liye tha jiskey paas haar pehnaai hui qurbaani na thi. Aur jiskey paas uski biwi thi to wo uskey liye halaal hai, aur khushbu aur kapdey. (Bukhari: 1545)"
"785","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka talbiya tha: Haaazir hun Ae Allah haaazir hun! Haaazir hun, tera koi shareek nahi, haaazir hun! Beshak hamd aur nemat terey liye aur baadshahat hai. Tera koi shareek nahi. (Bukhari: 1549)"
"786","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz padhi jabke ham Aap key sath Madina mein they, Zohar chaar (rakatein). Aur Asr Zul Hulaifa mein do (rakatein). Phir us mein raat guzaari yahan tak ke subah hui. Phir sawaar huey yahan tak ke wo Aap ko ley kar Baida par seedhi hui. Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki aur tasbeeh aur takbeer kahi. Phir Hajj aur Umrah ka talbiya kaha. Aur logon ne un donon ka talbiya kaha. Phir jab ham tashreef laaey to Aap ne logon ko hukm diya aur wo halaal ho gaey. Yahan tak ke jab Yaum-ut-Tarwiya tha to unhon-ne Hajj ka talbiya kaha. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qurbaani key oont apne haath se khadey (kar key) nahr kiye. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Madina mein do cheet-kabrey mendhey zibah kiye. (Bukhari: 1551)"
"787","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Zul Hulaifa se talbiya kehtey they. Phir jab Haram tak pahunchtey to ruk jaatey yahan tak ke jab Zu Tuwa aatey to us mein raat guzaartey yahan tak ke subah hoti. Phir jab Subah padhtey to ghusl kartey. Aur unhon-ne zikr kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa kartey they. (Bukhari: 1553)"
"788","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin Musa, goya main unhey dekh raha hun jab wo waadi mein utrey aur talbiya keh rahey hon. (Bukhari: 1555). Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya ke wo apne ehraam par qaem rahein. Aur Suraaqa key qaul ka zikr kya. (1557). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"789","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Yaman mein qaum ki taraf bheja. To main aaya jabke Aap Batha mein they. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kis ka talbiya kaha? Main ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key talbiya jaisa talbiya kaha. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumharey paas qurbaani hai? Main ne kaha: Nahi. To Aap ne mujhey hukm diya aur main ne Bait ka aur Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf kya. Phir Aap ne mujhey hukm diya aur main halaal ho gaya. To main apni qaum ki aik aurat key paas aaya. To us ne meri kanghi ki ya mera sar dhoya. Phir Umar (Raziallahu anhu) tashreef laaey. To unhon-ne kaha: Agar ham Allah ki Kitaab ko lein to wo hamein poora karney ka hukm deti hai. Allah ne farmaya: (Aur Hajj aur Umrah Allah key liye poora karo). Aur agar ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat ko lein to Aap halaal na huey yahan tak ke Aap ne qurbaani nahr ki. (Bukhari: 1559)"
"790","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, aur unki Hajj mein hadees guzar chuki hai. Unhon-ne is riwayat mein kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hajj key mahinon aur Hajj ki raaton aur Hajj key hurmat waley (mahinon) mein nikley. To ham Sarif mein utrey. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap apne sahaaba ki taraf nikley aur farmaya: Jo tum mein qurbaani sath na laaya ho aur chaahe ke use Umrah banaaey to karey. Aur jiskey paas qurbaani ho to nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: To usey apnaane waley aur usey chhorney waley Aap key sahaaba mein they. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba mein se aadmi taaqat waley they aur unkey paas qurbaani thi, to wo Umrah ki taaqat na rakkhey. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 1560)"
"791","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath nikley jabke ham sirf Hajj samajhtey they. Phir jab ham tashreef laaey to ham ne Bait ka tawaaf kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke jo qurbaani sath na laaya ho wo halaal ho jaey. To wo halaal ho gaya jo qurbaani sath na laaya tha. Aur Aapki biwiyaan qurbaani sath na laaein to wo halaal ho gaein. Safiya ne kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke main unhey rokney wali hun. Aap ne farmaya: Baanjh aur ganji ho! Kya tum ne Yaum-un-Nahr ko tawaaf na kya tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi, kooch karo. (Bukhari: 1561)"
"792","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik doosri riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hajjat-ul-Wada key saal nikley. To ham mein se kisi ne Umrah ka talbiya kaha. Aur ham mein se kisi ne Hajj aur Umrah ka talbiya kaha. Aur ham mein se kisi ne Hajj ka talbiya kaha. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajj ka talbiya kaha. To jo Hajj ka talbiya kehta ya Hajj aur Umrah ko jama karta wo halaal na huey yahan tak ke Yaum-un-Nahr tha. (Bukhari: 1562)"
"793","[AI-translation] Usmaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Mutah aur un donon ko jama karney se mana kya. Phir jab Ali ne dekha to un donon ka talbiya kaha: Haaazir hun Umrah aur Hajj key sath! Unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat ko kisi key qaul key liye chhorney wala nahi hun. (Bukhari: 1563)"
"794","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo samajhtey they ke Hajj key mahinon mein Umrah zameen mein sakht tareen fuhoosh mein se hai. Aur Muharram ko Safar banaatey they. Aur kehtey they: Jab oont ki peeth theek ho jaey aur nishaan mit jaey aur Safar nikal jaey to Umrah halaal ho gaya uskey liye jo Umrah karey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba chauthi ki subah tashreef laaey jabke wo Hajj ka talbiya kehtey huey they. To Aap ne unhey hukm diya ke use Umrah banaaein. To wo un par giraan guzra. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaunsa halaal hona? Aap ne farmaya: Poora halaal hona. (Bukhari: 1564)"
"795","[AI-translation] Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Logon ka kya haal hai ke wo Umrah key sath halaal ho gaey aur Aap apne Umrah se halaal na huey? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main ne apna sar (gondh kar) jamaaya hai aur apni qurbaani ko haar pehnaaya hai. To main halaal na hunga yahan tak ke nahr karun. (Bukhari: 1566)"
"796","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi ne Tamattu key baarey mein poochha aur kaha: Mujhey logon ne us se mana kya hai. To unhon-ne use uska hukm diya. Aadmi ne kaha: To main ne khwaab mein dekha goya aik aadmi mujh se kehta hai: Hajj-e-Mabroor aur Umrah-e-Maqbool! To main ne Ibn Abbas ko khabar di. To unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat. (Bukhari: 1576)"
"797","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hajj kya jis din Aap qurbaani key oont sath laaey they jabke unhon-ne Hajj ka akeley talbiya kaha tha. To Aap ne un se farmaya: Apne ehraam se halaal ho jao, Bait key tawaaf aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan (sayi) key sath, aur baal katwaao, phir halaal thehro yahan tak ke jab Yaum-ut-Tarwiya ho to Hajj ka talbiya kaho. Aur jo tum ley kar aey ho use Mutah banaao. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham use Mutah kaisey banaaein jabke ham ne Hajj ka naam liya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Karo jo main ne tumhey hukm diya hai. Phir agar main qurbaani sath na laata to waisa karta jaisa main ne tumhey hukm diya hai. Lekin mujh se haraam halaal na hoga yahan tak ke qurbaani apne thikaaney tak pahunchey. To unhon-ne aisa kya. (Bukhari: 1568)"
"798","[AI-translation] Imraan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein Tamattu kya. To Quran naazil hua. Aik aadmi ne apni raey se jo chaaha kaha. (Bukhari: 1571)"
"799","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah mein Kada se daakhil huey, baalaai ghaati se jo Batha mein hai. Aur nichli ghaati se nikley. (Bukhari: 1575). Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Kaaba banaaya gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abbas patthar uthaatey they. To Abbas ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Apna tehband apni gardan par rakkho. To Aap zameen par gir padey aur Aapki aankhein aasmaan ki taraf uth gaein. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey mera tehband dikhaao. To us ne use Aap par kas diya. (1582). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Mera tehband, mera tehband! (3829). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"800","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Hateem key baarey mein poochha, kya wo Bait mein se hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Main ne kaha: To unhey kya hua ke unhon-ne use Bait mein daakhil na kya? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tumhaari qaum ka kharcha kam pad gaya. Main ne kaha: To uskey darwaazey ka kya haal hai ke uncha hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhaari qaum ne aisa kya taake jisey chaahein daakhil karein aur jisey chaahein rokein. Aur agar tumhaari qaum ka jaahiliyat se ahd naya na hota aur mujhey khauf na hota ke unkey dil inkaar karengey ke main Hateem ko Bait mein daakhil karun aur uskey darwaazey ko zameen se milaa dun. (Bukhari: 1584)"
"801","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tumhaari qaum ka jaahiliyat se ahd naya na hota to main Bait ka hukm deta aur wo giraaya jaata. To us mein daakhil karta jo us se nikaala gaya hai aur use zameen se milaa deta aur uskey liye do darwaazey banaata, aik mashriqi darwaaza aur aik maghribi darwaaza. To use Ibrahim ki bunyaad tak pahunchaata. (Bukhari: 1586)"
"802","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum Makkah mein apne ghar mein kahaan utrogey? To Aap ne farmaya: Kya Aqeel ne chatyaanon ya gharon mein se kuchh chhoda hai? Aur Aqeel ne Abu Taalib ka waaris tha wo aur Taalib. Aur Jafar aur Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ne us se kuchh waaris na paaya kyunke wo donon Musalman they jabke Aqeel aur Taalib kaafir they. (Bukhari: 1588)"
"803","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Makkah tashreef laaney ka iraada kartey huey farmaya: Hamaara thikaana kal agar Allah ne chaaha Khaif Bani Kinaana mein hai jahaan unhon-ne kufr par qasam khai thi. Yaani wo Muhassab hai. Aur wo isliye ke Quraish aur Kinaana ne Bani Haashim aur Bani Abdul Muttalib ya Bani Muttalib par half khaai thi ke wo un se nikaah na karengey aur na khareed-o-farokht karengey yahan tak ke wo unhey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dey dein. (Bukhari: 1590)"
"804","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Kaaba ko chhoti pindliyon wala Habsha se veeraan karega. (Bukhari: 1591)"
"805","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Wo Ramazan farz honay se pehley Aashura ka rozah rakhtey they. Aur wo din tha jis mein Kaaba ko ghilaaf pehnaaya jaata tha. Phir jab Allah ne Ramazan farz kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chaahaaey ke use rozah rakkhey to rakkhey. Aur jo chaahaaey ke use chhorey to chhorey. (Bukhari: 1592)"
"806","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Bait ka Hajj aur Umrah zaroor kya jaaeyga Yajooj aur Majooj key nikalney key baad. (Bukhari: 1593)"
"807","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Goya main usey dekh raha hun, kaala phailay huey qadmon wala, use patthar patthar kar key ukhaadta hua. (Bukhari: 1595)"
"808","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Hajar-e-Aswad key paas aey aur use bosa diya. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main jaanta hun ke tu patthar hai, na nuqsaan pahunchaata hai aur na faeda. Aur agar main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tumhey bosa detey huey na dekhta to tumhey bosa na deta. (Bukhari: 1597)"
"809","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umrah kya. To Bait ka tawaaf kya aur Maqaam key peechey do rakatein padhein. Aur Aap key sath wo tha jo Aap ko logon se parda karta tha. To us se aik aadmi ne kaha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kaaba mein daakhil huey? Us ne kaha: Nahi. (Bukhari: 1600)"
"810","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab tashreef laaey to Bait mein daakhil honay se inkaar kya jabke us mein but they. To Aap ne unkey baarey mein hukm diya aur wo nikaaley gaey. To unhon-ne Ibrahim aur Ismail ki tasweer nikaali jabke unkey haathon mein teer they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah unhey halaak karey! Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam! Beshak wo jaan chukey they ke un donon ne unkey sath kabhi qura andaazi nahi ki. To Aap Bait mein daakhil huey aur uskey konon mein takbeer kahi aur us mein namaz na padhi. (Bukhari: 1601)"
"811","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap key sahaaba tashreef laaey. To mushrikeen ne kaha: Beshak tumharey paas aa rahey hain jabke unhey Yasrib ka bukhaar kamzor kar chuka hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey hukm diya ke wo teen pheron mein daud kar chalein aur donon ruknon key darmiyaan paidal chalein. Aur Aap ko unhey hukm deney se sirf un par rehem ne roka ke wo tamaam pheron mein daud kar chalein. (Bukhari: 1602)"
"812","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab Aap Makkah tashreef laatey to jab Kaaley Rukn ka iste laam kartey, pehla jo tawaaf kartey, saat mein se teen pheron mein daud kar chaltey. (Bukhari: 1603)"
"813","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Hamein Ramal se kya kaam? Beshak ham us se mushrikeen ko dikhaatey they jabke Allah ne unhey halaak kar diya hai. Phir kaha: Aisi cheez hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ki. To ham pasand nahi kartey ke use chhorein. (Bukhari: 1605)"
"814","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne in donon ruknon ka iste laam karna tangi aur khushhaali mein nahi chhoda jab se main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko un donon ka iste laam kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 1606)"
"815","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajjat-ul-Wada mein oont par tawaaf kya jabke Aap chhadi se Rukn ka iste laam kartey they. (Bukhari: 1607)"
"816","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi ne Hajar key iste laam key baarey mein poochha. To unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uska iste laam kartey huey aur use bosa detey huey dekha hai. To aadmi ne kaha: Bataaiye agar main bheed mein phas jaaun, bataaiye agar main maghloob ho jaaun? Unhon-ne kaha: Ara aita ko Yaman mein rakkho. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uska iste laam kartey huey aur use bosa detey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 1611)"
"817","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke pehli cheez jis se shuru kya jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laaey wo ye thi ke Aap ne wuzu kya, phir tawaaf kya. Phir wo Umrah na tha. Phir Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne Hajj kya, un jaisa. (Bukhari: 1614)"
"818","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key tawaaf ki hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur is riwayat mein izaafa kya: Ke Aap ne do sajdey kiye thein, phir Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan tawaaf kartey. (Bukhari: 1616)"
"819","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guzrey jabke Aap Kaaba ka tawaaf kar rahey they, aik insaan key paas jis ne apna haath doosrey insaan key haath se rassi ya dhaagey ya uskey siwa kisi cheez se baandha hua tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use apne haath se kaata, phir farmaya: Use apne haath se haanko. (Bukhari: 1620)"
"820","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddique (Raziallahu anhu) ne use us Hajj mein bheja jis par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey ameer banaaya tha, Hajjat-ul-Wada se pehley, Yaum-un-Nahr ko giroh mein, logon mein elaan karney key liye: Khabardaar! Is saal key baad koi mushrik Hajj na karey. Aur na Bait ka tawaaf nangey karey. (Bukhari: 1622)"
"821","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah tashreef laaey. To tawaaf kya aur Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan sayi ki. Aur Kaaba key qareeb na gaey, uska tawaaf karney key baad, yahan tak ke Arafaat se wapas aey. (Bukhari: 1625)"
"822","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi ke wo Mina ki raaton mein Makkah mein raat guzaarein apni saqaayat ki wajah se. To Aap ne unhey ijazat dey di. (Bukhari: 1634)"
"823","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Saqaaya key paas aey aur paani maanga. To Abbas ne kaha: Ae Fazl! Apni waalida key paas jao aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas unkey paas se sharb at laao. To Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey pilaao. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak wo us mein apney haath daaltey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey pilaao. To Aap ne us mein se piya. Phir Aap Zamzam key paas aey jabke wo pila rahey they aur us mein kaam kar rahey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Amal karo, beshak tum nek amal par ho. Phir farmaya: Agar tum maghloob na hotey to main utarta yahan tak ke rassi is par rakhta. Yaani apne kandhey par, aur Aap ne apne kandhey ki taraf ishaara kya. (Bukhari: 1635)"
"824","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Zamzam se pilaaya aur Aap ne piya jabke Aap khadey they. Aur aik riwayat mein hai unhi se: Ke wo us din oont par key siwa na they. (Bukhari: 1367)"
"825","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un se unkey bhatijay Urwa bin Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ne Allah Taala key qaul (Beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaaniyon mein se hain, phir jo Bait ka Hajj ya Umrah karey to us par koi gunaah nahi ke wo un donon ka tawaaf karey) key baarey mein poochha. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah ki qasam! Kisi par koi gunaah nahi ke wo Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf na karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne bura kaha ae merey bhatijay! Beshak ye agar waisa hota jaisa tum ne uski taaweel ki hai to hota: Us par koi gunaah nahi ke wo un donon ka tawaaf na karey. Lekin wo Ansaar key baarey mein naazil hui. Wo Musalman honay se pehley Manaat butt key liye talbiya kehtey they jiski wo Mushallal key paas ibaadat kartey they. To jo talbiya kehta wo Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf karney se bachta tha. Phir jab wo Musalman huey to unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein poochha. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham bachtey they ke Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan tawaaf karein. To Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: (Beshak Safa aur Marwa Allah ki nishaaniyon mein se hain) aayat. Aisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha: Aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon key darmiyaan tawaaf ko sunnat karaar diya hai. To kisi key liye un donon key darmiyaan tawaaf chhorna (jaaez) nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1643)"
"826","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab pehla tawaaf kartey to teen (pheron) mein daud kar chaltey aur chaar mein paidal chaltey. Aur naaley key pet mein daudtey jab Safa aur Marwa key darmiyaan tawaaf kartey. (Bukhari: 1644)"
"827","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aur Aap key sahaaba ne Hajj ka talbiya kaha jabke un mein se kisi key paas qurbaani na thi, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Talha key siwa. Aur Ali Yaman se aey jabke unkey paas qurbaani thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Main ne uska talbiya kaha jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne talbiya kaha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba ko hukm diya ke use Umrah banaaein aur tawaaf karein, phir baal katwaaein aur halaal ho jaaein, magar jo qurbaani sath laaya ho. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham Mina ki taraf jaaein jabke ham mein se kisi ka zikr tapak raha ho? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar main apne muamley mein pehley jaanta jo baad mein jaana to qurbaani sath na laata. Aur agar merey paas qurbaani na hoti to halaal ho jaata. (Bukhari: 1651)"
"828","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi ne poochha aur us ne un se kaha: Mujhey aisi cheez batao jo tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se samjhi hai: Aap ne Yaum-ut-Tarwiya ko Zohar aur Asr kahaan padhi? Unhon-ne kaha: Mina mein. Unhon-ne kaha: To Aap ne Nafar key din Asr kahaan padhi? Unhon-ne kaha: Abtah mein. Phir kaha: Karo jaisa tumharey ameeron kartey hain. (Bukhari: 1653)"
"829","[AI-translation] Umm-ul-Fazl (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Logon ne Arafaat key din Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key rozey mein shak kya. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf sharb at bheja aur Aap ne piya. (Bukhari: 1658)"
"830","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Arafaat key din aey jab sooraj dhal gaya tha. To Hajjaaj key khe mey key paas cheekhey. To wo nikla jabke us par zaafraani chaadar thi. To us ne kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Tumhey kya hua? To unhon-ne kaha: Jaldi karo agar tum sunnat chaahtey ho. Us ne kaha: Is ghadi? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: To mujhey mohlat do yahan tak ke main apne sar par paani baha lun, phir niklun. To wo utra yahan tak ke Hajjaaj nikla. To Saalim bin Abdullah ne us se kaha, aur wo apne waalid key sath they: Agar tum sunnat chaahtey ho to khutba chhota karo aur theharna jaldi karo. To wo Abdullah ki taraf dekhney laga. Phir jab Abdullah ne wo dekha to kaha: Us ne sach kaha. Aur Abdul Maalik ne Hajjaaj ko likha tha ke wo Hajj mein Ibn Umar ki mukhaalifat na karey. (Bukhari: 1660)"
"831","[AI-translation] Jubair bin Mutim (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apna oont gum kar diya aur use Arafaat key din talaash karney gaya. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Arafaat mein thehra hua dekha. To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ye Hums mein se hain, to unka yahaan kya kaam. (Bukhari: 1664)"
"832","[AI-translation] Usaama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se Hajjat-ul-Wada mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raftaar key baarey mein poochha gaya jab Aap ne kooch kya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap tez raftaar chaltey. Phir jab khula maidaan paatey to daudaaetay. (Bukhari: 1666)"
"833","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Arafaat key din wapas aey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne peechey sakht daant dapt aur maar aur oonton ki aawaaz suni. To Aap ne apne kodey se unki taraf ishaara kya aur farmaya: Ae logon! Tum par sukoon laazim hai. Beshak neki daudaanay mein nahi hai. (Bukhari: 1671)"
"834","[AI-translation] Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Jama ki raat Muzdalifa key paas utrein. To namaz padhney khadi huin. To ghadi bhar namaz padhi, phir kaha: Ae merey betey! Kya chaand ghaaeb ho gaya? Us ne kaha: Nahi. To ghadi bhar namaz padhi, phir kaha: Ae merey betey! Kya chaand ghaaeb ho gaya? Us ne kaha: Haan. Unhon-ne kaha: To kooch karo. To ham ne kooch kya aur chaley. Yahan tak ke Jamra ki rami ki. Phir wapas aaein aur apne thikaaney mein Subah padhi. To us ne un se kaha: Ae haan! Mera khayaal hai ke ham ne andherey mein (jaldi) ki hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae merey betey! Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kamzor auraton ko ijazat di thi. (Bukhari: 1679)"
"835","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Muzdalifa mein utrey. To Sauda ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi ke wo logon ki bheed se pehley chaley. Aur wo sust aurat thein. To Aap ne unhey ijazat dey di. To wo logon ki bheed se pehley chal dein. Aur ham thehrey yahan tak ke ham ne subah ki. Phir ham Aap key chalaney se chaley. To mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangna jaisey Sauda ne ijazat maangi thi us se zyada mehboob hai jo us se khush hua ho. (Bukhari: 1681)"
"836","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Jama mein aey aur donon namazein padhein, har namaz akeley azaan aur iqaamat key sath. Aur Isha un donon key darmiyaan. Phir Fajr padhi jab Fajr tulu hui. Kehney wala kehta hai: Fajr tulu hui. Aur kehney wala kehta hai: Fajr tulu nahi hui. Phir kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye donon namazein apne waqt se is jagah mein badal di gaein hain: Maghrib aur Isha. To log Jama mein na aaein yahan tak ke andhera ho jaey. Aur Fajr ki namaz is ghadi. Phir thehrey yahan tak ke ujaala hua. Phir kaha: Agar Ameer-ul-Momineen ab kooch karey to sunnat ko paa ley. To mujhey nahi maloom uska qaul tez tha ya Usmaan (Raziallahu anhu) ka chalna. To Aap musalsal talbiya kehtey rahey yahan tak ke Aap ne Yaum-un-Nahr ko Jamra-tul-Aqaba ki rami ki. (Bukhari: 1683)"
"837","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Jama mein Subah padhi, phir thehrey aur kaha: Beshak mushrikeen kooch na kartey they yahan tak ke sooraj nikley. Aur wo kehtey they: Chamko Sabeer! Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki mukhaalifat ki. Phir Aap ne sooraj nikalney se pehley kooch kya. (Bukhari: 1684)"
"838","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko dekha jo qurbaani key oont ko haank raha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawaar ho. To us ne kaha: Beshak wo qurbaani ka oont hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawaar ho. Us ne kaha: Beshak wo qurbaani ka oont hai. Aap ne farmaya: Us par sawaar ho, tum par afsos! Teesri ya doosri mein. (Bukhari: 1689)"
"839","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajjat-ul-Wada mein Umrah se Hajj tak Tamattu kya. Aur qurbaani di. To Aap apne sath Zul Hulaifa se qurbaani laaey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shuru kya aur Umrah ka talbiya kaha, phir Hajj ka talbiya kaha. To logon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Umrah se Hajj tak Tamattu kya. To logon mein se kisi ne qurbaani di aur qurbaani sath laaey. Aur un mein se koi tha jo qurbaani na laaya. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makkah tashreef laaey to logon se farmaya: Jo tum mein qurbaani laaya hai to beshak wo kisi cheez key liye halaal na hoga jo us par haraam hui hai yahan tak ke wo apna Hajj poora karey. Aur jo tum mein qurbaani na laaya ho to Bait ka aur Safa aur Marwa ka tawaaf karey aur baal katwaaey aur halaal ho jaey, phir Hajj ka talbiya kahey. Phir jo qurbaani na paaey to Hajj mein teen din rozey rakkhey aur saat jab apne ghar walon ki taraf wapas aaey. (Bukhari: 1691)"
"840","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Makhrama aur Marwaan (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya key zamaaney mein Madina se apne sahaaba mein se pandrah sau key qareeb key sath nikley. Yahan tak ke jab wo Zul Hulaifa mein they to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qurbaani ko haar pehnaaya aur usey nishaan lagaaya aur Umrah ka ehraam baandha. (Bukhari: 1694, 1695)"
"841","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bakriyaan qurbaan kein. (Bukhari: 1701)"
"842","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bakriyon ko haar pehnaaya jabke Aap merey paas apne ghar walon mein halaal thehrey. (Bukhari: 1702)"
"843","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: To main ne unkey haar oon se bantey jo merey paas thi. (Bukhari: 1705)"
"844","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya ke main un oonton key jhol sadqa karun jo main ne nahr kiye aur unki khaalein. (Bukhari: 1707)"
"845","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, wo kehtin hain: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Zul Qaada ki paanch (raatein) baaqi honay par nikley. Ye guzar chuki hai aur is riwayat mein izaafa hai: To hamaarey paas Yaum-un-Nahr ko gaey ka gosht laaya gaya. To main ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni biwiyon ki taraf se (gaey) nahr ki. (Bukhari: 1707)"
"846","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Manhar mein nahr kartey they. Yaani Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key manhar mein. (Bukhari: 1710)"
"847","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke unhon-ne aik aadmi ko dekha jis ne apni qurbaani key oont ko bithaaya hua tha aur use nahr kar raha tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Use khada kar key bhejho jabke uska (aik paon) baandha hua ho, Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat par. (Bukhari: 1713)"
"848","[AI-translation] Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya ke main oonton par khada hun aur un par unhey zibah karney mein kuchh na dun. (Bukhari: 1716)"
"849","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham apne qurbaani key oonton key gosht mein se Mina mein teen (din) se zyada na khaatey they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein rukhsat di aur farmaya: Khaao aur tosha banao. To ham ne khaaya aur tosha banaaya. (Bukhari: 1719)"
"850","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne Hajj mein sar mundwaaya. (Bukhari: 1726)"
"851","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Mundwaanay walon par rehem farma. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur katwaaney walon par Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah! Mundwaanay walon par rehem farma. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur katwaaney walon par Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Aur katwaaney walon par. (Bukhari: 1727)"
"852","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se us jaisa (marwi hai) magar ye ke unhon-ne farmaya: Maaf farma, rehem farma key badley. Aap ne use teen martaba kaha. Farmaya: Aur katwaaney walon key liye."
"853","[AI-translation] Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key (sar) katrey nochney se. (Bukhari: 1730)"
"854","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se aik aadmi ne poochha: Main Jamraat ki rami kab karun? Unhon-ne kaha: Jab tumhara Imam rami karey to rami karo. To main ne us par sawaal dohraaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham andaza kartey they, phir jab sooraj dhal jaata to rami kartey. (Bukhari: 1746)"
"855","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne naaley key pet se rami ki. To un se kaha gaya: Beshak log use uskey upar se maartey hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Qasam us zaat ki jiskey siwa koi mabood nahi! Ye uska maqaam hai jis par Surah Baqarah naazil hui (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam). (Bukhari: 1747)"
"856","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abdullah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke wo badey Jamra tak pahunchey. Unhon-ne Bait ko apne baaen taraf aur Mina ko apne daaen taraf kya aur saat (kankariyaan) maarein. Aur kaha: Aisa maara us ne jis par Surah Baqarah naazil hui (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)."
"857","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo chhotey Jamra ko saat kankariyaan maartey they, har kankari key peechey takbeer kehtey huey. Phir aagey badhtey yahan tak ke naram (zameen) mein aatey aur qibley ki taraf munh kar key khadey hotey. To lambi der khadey rehtey aur dua kartey aur apney haath uthaatey. Phir darmiyaani ko maartey, phir baaen taraf letey aur naram (zameen) mein aatey aur qibley ki taraf munh kar key khadey hotey. To lambi der khadey rehtey aur dua kartey aur apney haath uthaatey aur lambi der khadey rehtey. Phir Aqaba waley Jamra ko naaley key pet se maartey aur uskey paas na thehartey. Phir wapas aatey aur kehtey: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 1751)"
"858","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Logon ko hukm diya gaya ke unka aakhri ahd Bait se ho, magar ye ke haaeza se takhfeef ki gai hai. (Bukhari: 1755)"
"859","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zohar aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha padhein. Phir Muhassab mein raat bhar ki neend soey. Phir sawaar ho kar Bait ki taraf gaey aur uska tawaaf kya. (Bukhari: 1756)"
"860","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Haaeza key liye rukhsat di gai hai ke wo wapas jaey jab wo (tawaaf-e-ifaaza) kar chuki ho. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ne Ibn Umar ko kehtey huey suna: Beshak wo wapas na jaey. Phir main ne unhey uskey baad kehtey huey suna: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey rukhsat di hai. (Bukhari: 1760-1761)"
"861","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Tehseeb kuchh nahi hai. Beshak wo thikaana hai jahaan Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey they. (Bukhari: 1766)"
"862","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo jab aatey to Zu Tuwa mein raat guzaartey yahan tak ke jab subah hoti to daakhil hotey. Aur jab wapas jaatey to Zu Tuwa se guzartey aur us mein raat guzaartey yahan tak ke subah hoti. Aur wo zikr kartey they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisa kartey they. (Bukhari: 1769). Umrah ki kitaab."
